function profileXmlFromForm(){if(!caProfileDocument)return'';const parsed=new DOMParser().parseFromString(new XMLSerializer().serializeToString(caProfileDocument),'application/xml'),root=parsed.documentElement,originalChildren=[...root.children],rows=[...document.querySelectorAll('.profile-field-row')],rowByIndex=new Map(rows.filter(row=&gt;row.dataset.originalIndex!=='').map(row=&gt;[Number(row.dataset.originalIndex),row]));for(const index of caProfileOriginalLeafIndexes){const node=originalChildren[index],row=rowByIndex.get(index);if(!row){if(node?.parentNode===root)root.removeChild(node);continue}const name=row.querySelector('.profile-field-name').value.trim(),value=row.querySelector('.profile-field-value').value;if(!/^[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_.-]*$/.test(name)||/^xml/i.test(name))continue;if(node.tagName!==name){const replacement=parsed.createElement(name);for(const attr of [...node.attributes])replacement.setAttribute(attr.name,attr.value);replacement.textContent=value;root.replaceChild(replacement,node)}else node.textContent=value}for(const row of rows.filter(item=&gt;item.dataset.originalIndex==='')){const name=row.querySelector('.profile-field-name').value.trim(),value=row.querySelector('.profile-field-value').value;if(!value.trim()||!/^[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_.-]*$/.test(name)||/^xml/i.test(name))continue;const node=parsed.createElement(name);node.textContent=value;root.appendChild(node)}const body=new XMLSerializer().serializeToString(parsed).replace(/&gt;&lt;/g,'&gt;\n    &lt;').replace(/&lt;([A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_.-]*)\/&gt;/g,'&lt;$1&gt;&lt;/$1&gt;');return'&lt;?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?&gt;\n'+body}
function updateCAProfilePreview(){if(caProfileDocument)document.querySelector('#caProfilePreview').textContent=profileXmlFromForm()}
function fillCAProfileForm(){if(!caProfileDocument)return;const root=caProfileDocument.documentElement,box=document.querySelector('#caProfileForm');box.replaceChildren();caProfileOriginalLeafIndexes=new Set();const present=new Set();[...root.children].forEach((node,index)=&gt;{if(node.children.length)return;caProfileOriginalLeafIndexes.add(index);present.add(node.tagName);addCAProfileField(node.tagName,node.textContent.trim(),index)});for(const field of caProfileFields)if(!present.has(field))addCAProfileField(field,'');updateCAProfilePreview()}
